                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "495e0d5b-6fc7-3b43-8aca-0c2eb58009f4",
                        "entry_id": "9608f64e-c3d3-3108-80ae-54ef7b11e811",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to, or having the form, nature, or habits of, a beast."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6fe60c72-4673-3c1d-8480-a04b5299d4cf",
                        "entry_id": "9608f64e-c3d3-3108-80ae-54ef7b11e811",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Similar to the nature of a beast; contrary to the nature and dignity of human beings."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b4f34f0-25cd-45b2-949b-59a4791b1060",
                                "sense_id": "6fe60c72-4673-3c1d-8480-a04b5299d4cf",
                                "text": "beastly culture"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "54dcaeb0-8070-3de2-9cb8-171d0a11741c",
                        "entry_id": "9608f64e-c3d3-3108-80ae-54ef7b11e811",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Abominable; very unpleasant; hideous."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5753ecc-b549-47f7-92f4-4d88bfdda3b3",
                                "sense_id": "54dcaeb0-8070-3de2-9cb8-171d0a11741c",
                                "text": "beastly weather"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0df9dbb6-4ab3-47ba-b4ac-2862fe5f1843",
                                "sense_id": "54dcaeb0-8070-3de2-9cb8-171d0a11741c",
                                "text": "Stop being so beastly to her!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2872f276-817e-413b-a487-6e8db3cfc637",
                                "sense_id": "54dcaeb0-8070-3de2-9cb8-171d0a11741c",
                                "text": "And all the time, whenever we went to the Cedars, there was all sorts of silly fuss going on about the beastly wedding; boxes coming from London with hats and jackets in, and wedding presents—all glassy and silvery, or else brooches and chains—and clothes sent down from London to choose from."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "789b1a49-892b-46e0-9c9e-c89a0ab60f6e",
                                "sense_id": "54dcaeb0-8070-3de2-9cb8-171d0a11741c",
                                "text": "“Yes, I’ve got the most beastly headache.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "551e60f7-1fa0-4214-add0-d89f5cc6f3bc",
                                "sense_id": "54dcaeb0-8070-3de2-9cb8-171d0a11741c",
                                "text": "\"If you saw the care she takes over hoisting her beastly old carcass up and down those stairs, you could make a sure bet against her having another accident there.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15b128a6-7adc-33eb-af8d-09190cd85670",
                        "entry_id": "9608f64e-c3d3-3108-80ae-54ef7b11e811",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of computer hardware or motor vehicles etc.: ostentatiously powerful."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "986129c9-a701-4e0a-adb2-9e3a0ac6e12f",
                                "sense_id": "15b128a6-7adc-33eb-af8d-09190cd85670",
                                "text": "In addition to a Core i7-860 with a full-sized heatsink and 4GB of DDR3 RAM, the company showed its SUGO SG07 housing today's most beastly graphics card, the dual-GPU Radeon HD 5970, which is about 30cm long."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1c6664a-2a10-4b4b-b55a-172d18e83792",
                                "sense_id": "15b128a6-7adc-33eb-af8d-09190cd85670",
                                "text": "A very big, very black, and very beastly Hummer H2, Spotted in China in in the rain the great city of Zigong in Sichuan Province."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fc9155e-8e5f-4c89-a4df-496e9c74b19a",
                                "sense_id": "15b128a6-7adc-33eb-af8d-09190cd85670",
                                "text": "Huawei’s Mate 20 phones have instantly become the best iPhone XS rivals out there, at least on paper, and the high-end model is easily the most beastly Android phone the world has seen so far."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
